---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Checks every bundle entry against an inventory with a separately trusted SHA-256. Does not contact or verify a running server

Usage: leptoskit verify check --bundle <BUNDLE> --manifest <MANIFEST> --sha256 <SHA256>

Options:
      --bundle <BUNDLE>      The extracted backend bundle directory
      --manifest <MANIFEST>  The inventory written by `verify record`
      --sha256 <SHA256>      The expected inventory digest, obtained independently of the bundle
  -h, --help                 Print help
  -V, --version              Print version
